                    <h3>MinGW-w64 - for 32 and 64 bit Windows Overview</h3>
                </div>

                <div class="project-container">
                    
                    <p id="summary">A complete runtime environment for gcc</p>
                    
                    <p id="description">The mingw-w64 project is a complete runtime environment for gcc to support binaries native to Windows 64-bit and 32-bit operating systems.</p>
